    "description": "Set 1\n\nBertha, Playin' In The Band, Loser, Mr. Charlie, Cumberland Blues, Brokedown Palace, Me And Bobby McGee, Hard To Handle, Casey Jones\n\nSet 2\n\nSaint Stephen, Truckin'-> Drums-> The Other One-> Me & My Uncle-> The Other One, Deal, Sugar Magnolia, Morning Dew, Turn On Your Love Light\n\n\"WRS Prelude' tease after \"Me & My Uncle\" - Other artist(s): NRPS -full moon -,full lunar eclipse 'Sugaree\" appears on some audience tapes, but may be from another show. The stellar Hard to Handle from the circulating AUD can be heard on the commercial release <a href=\"http://mars.dead.net\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">Fallout from the Phil Zone</a>.",
