    "notes": "Digitally Remastered using the Bertha Digital Audio Workstation by jashley@deadacated.com. Completed 6/8/2009\n\nFrequency analysis shows a change in the analog fingerprint at around 1:35:15. There also appears to be a crossfade at this point.  The first half fingerprint continues on past 22khz and the second half fingerprint rolls off at 20khz. The second half is slightly compressed, which can be seen in wave analysis.  It's not clear if these are from two different sources but the fingerprints are clearly different.\n\nDue to the difference between the two halves each was processed separately to create a even sound between the two.\n\nEnjoy!",
